          "Ethernet, programming, high-speed modes, firmware, limits, protection and complete installation requirements are not modeled.",
          "The cited manual requires unused analog inputs to be shorted. Author any required connections explicitly in the project.",
          "Nominal 24 V supply / digital I/O and nominal 10 V analog full scale are descriptive ratings, not a full compatibility or range check."
